{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL0ZsaWdodCUyMG9mJTIwdGhlJTIwUGhvZW5peCUyMCUyODIwMDQlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Flight of the Phoenix","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/pcj6unMsKCw0ogWFlUXmbc9gKap.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mWXU29QjfjEG37d0c2hE11MWRGq.jpg","description":"When an oil rig in the Gobi Desert of Mongolia proves unproductive, an aircraft crew are sent to shut the operation down and fly them out. On the flight out over the desert on the way to Beijing, Capt. Frank Towns and co-pilot A.J. are unable to keep their cargo plane, a C-119 Flying Boxcar, in the air when a violent sandstorm strikes. Crash-landing in a remote uncharted part of the desert, the two pilots and their passengers -- a crew of oil workers and a drifter -- must work together to survive by rebuilding the aircraft. Soon, low supplies and a band of merciless smugglers add even greater urgency to their task.\n\nRated PG-13 · Released 17 Dec 2004 · United States of America · Language: English · 113 min\nStudio: Optional Pictures, Davis Entertainment, Aldrich Group\n\nOn your server — Audio: English · Subtitle files: English","releaseInfo":"2004","genres":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.0","runtime":"113 min","cast":["Dennis Quaid","Tyrese Gibson","Giovanni Ribisi","Miranda Otto","Tony Curran","Sticky Fingaz","Jacob Vargas","Hugh Laurie"],"director":["John Moore"],"released":"2004-12-17T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Out of the ashes, hope will rise.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"John Moore","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/n3czTYjeuJHaTLvMHllnT35uhnF.jpg"},{"name":"Dennis Quaid","character":"Frank Towns","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lMaDAJHzsKH7U3dln2B3kY3rOhE.jpg"},{"name":"Tyrese Gibson","character":"AJ","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jxoy4fbXNKFQtBdK73cLXEz3ufS.jpg"},{"name":"Giovanni Ribisi","character":"Elliott","photo":